    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2211640/extras/f444a8b176f6f5dfba0ebf7b186fb590.poster.avif?t=1727865591\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2211640/extras/f444a8b176f6f5dfba0ebf7b186fb590.webm?t=1727865591\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2211640/extras/f444a8b176f6f5dfba0ebf7b186fb590.mp4?t=1727865591\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>Who Knocks</strong> is a first person psychological horror game, built to give you anxiety and distressing feelings.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2211640/extras/bfccaa25cd4fafc09ff4496b3b5384dc.webp?t=1727865591\" /></div><br>Noam Elfer has just moved into his new home in the country and is about to experience the longest night of his life. Welcome the entities who will knock at the front door during the night. Learn about their past and how they died inside the house. Get ready to experience Noam's nightmares and help him get back in touch with reality.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2211640/extras/0cc732fafe2cae7e50a6afa2abed6e17.webp?t=1727865591\" /></div><br>Each character in Who Knocks has a dramatic story that directly intertwines with Noam's life. Find out how each link has an impact on Noam's nightmare.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2211640/extras/d2ae69af7fdbc994f694fdc1ff437106.webp?t=1727865591\" /></div><br>Gather items and clues that will help you fulfill the entities' requests.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"